tire/devenv/cli_experiments/cmd/entire/cli/api_client.go` (helper)\n- `/Users/soph/Work/entire/devenv/cli_experiments/cmd/entire/cli/api/base_url.go` (URL configuration)\n\n**Pattern for authenticated API calls:**\n\n```go\n// Get authenticated client\nclient, err := NewAuthenticatedAPIClient(false)  // false = require secure HTTPS\nif err != nil {\n    return fmt.Errorf(\"API client setup: %w\", err)\n}\n\n// Make API calls\nresp, err := client.Get(ctx, \"/api/endpoint\")\nif err != nil {\n    return fmt.Errorf(\"API request: %w\", err)\n}\ndefer resp.Body.Close()\n\n// Check response\nif err := api.CheckResponse(resp); err != nil {\n    return err\n}\n\n// Decode JSON\nvar result MyType\nif err := api.DecodeJSON(resp, &result); err != nil {\n    return err\n}\n```\n\n**API Client methods available:**\n- `Get(ctx, path)` - GET request\n- `Post(ctx, path, body)` - POST with JSON body\n- `Put(ctx, path, body)` - PUT with JSON body\n- `Patch(ctx, path, body)` - PATCH with JSON body\n- `Delete(ctx, path)` - DELETE request\n- `DecodeJSON(resp, dest)` - Helper to decode response\n- `CheckResponse(resp)` - Verify 2xx status\n\nThe client automatically injects the Bearer token in the `Authorization` header via a custom `RoundTripper`.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Authentication & Token Management\n\n**Files:**\n- `/Users/soph/Work/entire/devenv/cli_experiments/cmd/entire/cli/auth/store.go` (token storage)\n- `/Users/soph/Work/entire/devenv/cli_experiments/cmd/entire/cli/auth/client.go` (OAuth device flow)\n\n**Pattern to get auth token:**\n\n```go\ntoken, err := auth.LookupCurrentToken()  // Returns \"\" if not logged in\nif err != nil {\n    return fmt.Errorf(\"reading credentials: %w\", err)\n}\nif token == \"\" {\n    return errors.New(\"not authenticated. Run 'entire login' to authenticate\")\n}\n```\n\n**Token storage mechanism:**\n- Uses OS keyring via `github.com/zalando/go-keyring`\n- Service name: `\"entire-cli\"`\n- Tokens are stored per base URL (`api.BaseURL()`)\n- `auth.NewStore()` creates a store instance\n- `store.GetToken(baseURL)` retrieves, `store.SaveToken(baseURL, token)` saves, `store.DeleteToken(baseURL)` removes\n\n**Login command** uses OAuth device flow (`auth.Client`):\n- `StartDeviceAuth()` - Initiates auth\n- `PollDeviceAuth(deviceCode)` - Polls for user approval\n- Result token is saved to keyring\n\n---\n\n### 4. Charmbracelet Dependencies\n\n**Available in go.mod:**\n- `github.com/charmbracelet/bubbletea v1.3.10` - TUI framework\n- `github.com/charmbracelet/bubbles v0.21.1` - Reusable components (textinput, viewport, cursor, etc.)\n- `github.com/charmbracelet/lipgloss v1.1.0` - Styling and layout\n- `github.com/charmbracelet/huh v0.8.0` - Form/prompt library\n\n**Transitive deps:**\n- `charmbracelet/colorprofile`, `charmbracelet/x/ansi`, `charmbracelet/x/cellbuf`, `charmbracelet/x/term`\n\n---\n\n### 5. Existing TUI Patterns\n\n**File:** `/Users/soph/Work/entire/devenv/cli_experiments/cmd/entire/cli/status_style.go`\n\n**Style initialization pattern:**\n\n```go\n// Create styles appropriate for writer (terminal vs piped)\nstyles := newStatusStyles(w)  // Returns statusStyles struct\n\ntype statusStyles struct {\n    colorEnabled bool\n    width        int\n    green        lipgloss.Style\n    red          lipgloss.Style\n    gray         lipgloss.Style\n    // ... more styles\n}\n\n// Use styles\nfunc (s statusStyles) render(style lipgloss.Style, text string) string {\n    if !s.colorEnabled {\n        return text\n    }\n    return style.Render(text)\n}\n```\n\n**Search TUI example** (`/Users/soph/Work/entire/devenv/cli_experiments/cmd/entire/cli/search_tui.go`):\n\n```go\n// Create lipgloss styles for interactive UI\ns.sectionTitle = lipgloss.NewStyle().Bold(true).Foreground(lipgloss.Color(\"244\"))\ns.selected = lipgloss.NewStyle().Foreground(lipgloss.Color(\"214\")).Bold(true)\ns.detailBorder = lipgloss.NewStyle().\n    Border(lipgloss.RoundedBorder()).\n    BorderForeground(lipgloss.Color(\"243\")).\n    Padding(1, 2)\n\n// Create bubbletea model\ntype searchModel struct {\n    results    []search.Result\n    cursor     int\n    width      int\n    height     int\n    styles     searchStyles\n    browseVP   viewport.Model\n    input      textinput.Model\n}\n\n// Implement tea.Model interface\nfunc (m searchModel) Init() tea.Cmd { ... }\nfunc (m searchModel) Update(msg tea.Msg) (tea.Model, tea.Cmd) { ... }\nfunc (m searchModel) View() string { ... }\n\n// Run TUI\np := tea.NewProgram(model, tea.WithAltScreen())\nif _, err := p.Run(); err != nil {\n    return err\n}\n```\n\n**Accessibility mode:**\n- Check `IsAccessibleMode()` to use simpler text output instead of TUI\n- Environment variable `ACCESSIBLE=1` enables it\n- Useful for piped output or screen readers\n\n---\n\n### 6. Settings & Configuration\n\n**File:** `/Users/soph/Work/entire/devenv/cli_experiments/cmd/entire/cli/settings/settings.go`\n\n**Configuration file locations:**\n- `.entire/settings.json` - Committed settings\n- `.entire/settings.local.json` - Local override (not committed)\n\n**API base URL configuration:**\n- **Environment variable:** `ENTIRE_API_BASE_URL` (takes precedence)\n- **Default:** `https://entire.io` (from `api/base_url.go`)\n- **Search service URL:** `ENTIRE_SEARCH_URL` environment variable (defaults to `https://entire.io`)\n\n**Pattern to use base URL:**\n\n```go\n// Get current effective base URL\nbaseURL := api.BaseURL()  // Checks env var first, then uses default\n\n// Resolve API paths\nendpoint, err := api.ResolveURL(\"/api/path\")  // Full URL\nendpoint, err := api.ResolveURLFromBase(baseURL, \"/api/path\")\n\n// Require secure HTTPS for auth\nif err := api.RequireSecureURL(baseURL); err != nil {\n    return err  // Returns ErrInsecureHTTP if http://\n}\n```\n\n**Settings struct** contains:\n- `Enabled` - Whether Entire is active\n- `LogLevel` - Logging verbosity\n- `StrategyOptions` - Strategy-specific config\n- `Telemetry` - Analytics opt-in/out (nil = not asked)\n- `Redaction` 